Once rumored to have lost his mind to voices in his head, the founder and leader of the [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]] — a protection racket in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]] — appears instead to have struck a deal with someone in [[Org/Pyrelight/index|Pyrelight]]. Formerly unable to wield magic, he now pilots a simulacrum to work on his behalf — most recently, to open a roller rink.
